      "note": "about 的第一个音节很轻；ˈ 表示后面音节重读。",
      "examples": [
        {
          "word": "about",
          "ipa": "əˈbaʊt",
          "meaning": "关于"
        },
        {
          "word": "teacher",
          "ipa": "ˈtiːtʃə",
          "meaning": "老师"
        },
        {
          "word": "banana",
          "ipa": "bəˈnɑːnə",
          "meaning": "香蕉"
