      "note": "和 /p/ 用同一发音部位，注意清浊差异。",
      "examples": [
        {
          "word": "book",
          "ipa": "bʊk",
          "meaning": "书"
        },
        {
          "word": "boy",
          "ipa": "bɔɪ",
          "meaning": "男孩"
